 - 2026-06-14: PHASE A2 (DECISIVE, gated_on A1 headroom>=0.10) — the EFFICIENCY moat: Carnot executable/energy verifier + V-STaR selector (ARM A) vs LLM-as-judge (ARM J) vs SC-vote (ARM B) vs oracle, on the headroom-present executable domain. Report accuracy parity (bootstrap CI95 on pass@1(A)-pass@1(J)) AND the REAL cost ratio (verifier wall-clock/tokens / judge wall-clock/tokens). verifier_efficiency_win := A within-CI of J on accuracy AND >=10x cheaper (or strict Pareto-dominance). Resolves the north-star §5 efficiency-parity question with REAL cost (fixes the .387 abstract-cost-unit caveat). (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: verifier_efficiency_win_true_delta_0.1800; results/experiment_4186_efficiency_moat_verifier_vs_llm_judge.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE B1 — GAP-4 graded execution-energy gate (production-safe). Implement+validate the graded min-hamming gate (tau=0.005 ONLY + a vote-aware guard blocking the measured exact-match mis-promotion over high-vote gold, the 25094a63 case) on the non-degenerate ARC-1 venue. The agreement signal STAYS a confidence label only (exp4023 retired agreement-as-selector). Report pass@1/pass@2 vs vote, the gross +/- ledger, and band precision at tau<=0.02. Makes the proven +4/-0 GAP-4 verifier safe for a richer candidate pool. READ-ONLY w.r.t. TRM training. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: gap4_graded_relaxation_adds_nothing_on_arc1_holds_exact_baseline_n31_vote_0.4516_graded_0.5806_recovered_4_lost_0_guarded_25094a63; results/experiment_4187_gap4_graded_execution_gate_hardening.json
 - 2026-06-14: PHASE B2 (SELF-LEARNING + decentralization) — Sovereign local generator + GAP-4-verified self-distillation. Replace codex with a LOCAL open-weight generator (gemma-4-26B-A4B-it-GGUF / Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-GGUF) for ARC program induction: does a fully-sovereign generator + the hardened GAP-4 execution verifier recover ARC headroom with NO closed-weight call (decentralization rule 1)? The verifier labels demo-perfect induced programs; those verified programs form a self-distillation corpus (Tier-2/Tier-3 — the verifier TEACHES the local generator). Report local induction rate vs codex, pool-rerank pass@2, distillation-corpus size. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: sovereign_local_gap4_recovers_headroom_pass20.4839_cov0.2258_corpus7; results/experiment_4188_sovereign_local_generator_gap4_self_distill.json
+- 2026-06-14: PHASE C1 — DiffusionGemma verifier-guided decoding (gate MET; feasibility + smoke). The DiffusionGemma gate flipped MET (exp4177). HARD PRECONDITION: DiffusionGemma cached/downloadable AND exposes per-step token logits (NOT cached as of 2026-06-14 — else honest blocked verdict). Use Carnot's EXECUTABLE verifier ensemble as the GUIDANCE energy reweighting per-step token selection during denoising on an executable domain (code/Sudoku); guided vs unguided vs AR-baseline, small n, bootstrap CI. Feasibility+smoke (NOT a headline benchmark); a clean blocked verdict is COMPLETE and de-risks the .389 scale-up. (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=blocked_diffusiongemma_not_cached; results/experiment_4189_diffusiongemma_verifier_guided_decoding.json
